# ===========================================
# AI Resume Assistant - Personal Files Exclusion
# ===========================================
# This .gitignore excludes personal information while keeping
# the reusable workflow logic shareable.

# ===========================================
# PERSONAL RESUME & COVER LETTER FILES
# ===========================================
# Exclude all actual resumes (keep only examples/)
*Resume*.txt
*Resume*.pdf
*Resume*.docx
*CoverLetter*.txt
*CoverLetter*.pdf
*CoverLetter*.docx

# ===========================================
# SOURCE OF TRUTH DOCUMENTS (Personal Experience)
# ===========================================
*_Truth.md
*_Reference.md
*_Experience*.md
*Complete_Experience*.md

# Personal documents
*LinkedIn*.pdf
*Projects List*.docx

# ===========================================
# JOB APPLICATION HISTORY (Personal)
# ===========================================
Job_Application_Tracker.csv
Job_Search_Queue.csv

# ===========================================
# APPLICATION FOLDERS (Personal History)
# ===========================================
Archive/
JobSearches/

# ===========================================
# PERSONAL CLAUDE.MD (Keep template version)
# ===========================================
# The main CLAUDE.md contains personal skills/contact info
# Users should copy CLAUDE.template.md to CLAUDE.md and customize
CLAUDE.md

# ===========================================
# PERSONAL ANTI-FABRICATION CHECKLIST
# ===========================================
# Contains person-specific skills to verify
ANTI_FABRICATION_CHECKLIST.md

# ===========================================
# SYSTEM FILES
# ===========================================
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
~$*
~WRL*.tmp
*.tmp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
nul

# Claude Code session files
.claude/
*.txt.bak

# Conversation logs (date-prefixed files)
202[0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-*.txt

# Personal job board notes (has account status etc)
Job_Boards_Ranked.md

# ===========================================
# WHAT IS TRACKED (for reference)
# ===========================================
# The following ARE included in the repo:
# - create_pdf.py (PDF generation script)
# - create_cover_letter_docx.py (if exists)
# - Job_Boards.csv (public job board list)
# - CLAUDE.template.md (template with placeholders)
# - examples/ folder (template files for new users)
# - README.md (setup instructions)
